<body>

<div class="header-box">
    <h1>BHUMI CONTAINER SERVICE</h1>
    <p><strong>Fleet & Transport Management System (TMS) • Standard Operating Procedure (SOP)</strong></p>
    <p>Vadodara Hub • Complete User Guide & Step-by-Step Operations Flow</p>
</div>

<h2>🎯 Master Workflow Summary (Kaha se Shuru, Kaha Khatam?)</h2>
<p>Yeh software Bhumi Container Service ke pure transport vyapaar ko 3 hisson me chalata hai:</p>
<ol>
    <li><strong>Masters Setup (Pehla Kadam):</strong> Party, Truck, Driver aur Bank account save karna.</li>
    <li><strong>Daily Operations (Raste ka Kaam):</strong> Advance Memo banana ➔ Trip Dispatch ➔ Live Highway Tracking ➔ Delivery & POD Receiving.</li>
    <li><strong>Financial Settlements (Hisab-Kitab):</strong> Own Fleet Lorry Settlement / Broker Bill ➔ Party ka GST Invoice ➔ Bank Payment ➔ Net Profit.</li>
</ol>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>1️⃣ STEP 1: Pehla Kadam — Master Data Setup (Yaha se Shuru Hoga)</h2>
<p>Software shuru karte hi sabse pehle 4 buniyaadi Master tables bharein:</p>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Module</th>
            <th>Sidebar Location</th>
            <th>Kya Bharna Hai?</th>
            <th>Kyu Zaroori Hai?</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Company Profile & Bank</strong></td>
            <td><code>Settings (/settings)</code></td>
            <td>Company Name, Vadodara Address, Phone, GSTIN, Axis Bank A/C No: <code>920020062626814</code>, IFSC: <code>UTIB0003260</code>.</td>
            <td>Yeh saari bank details har Advance Memo slip aur Invoice ke footer par auto-print hoti hain.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Customer Master (Parties)</strong></td>
            <td><code>Customer Master (/customers)</code></td>
            <td>Parties ka naam (e.g. <em>M/s V-Trans Chennai, DHL, TCI</em>), Contact Person, Mobile, GSTIN, Billing Address.</td>
            <td>Advance Memo aur Trip banate waqt party ka naam dropdown me 1-click me aayega.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Vehicle Master (Fleet)</strong></td>
            <td><code>Vehicles (/vehicles)</code></td>
            <td>Truck No (e.g. <em>MH 04 KY 8233</em>), Type (20FT Container / 40FT Trailer), Chassis No, Engine No, RC, Fitness, Insurance, Permit, PUC Expiry Dates.</td>
            <td>Document expire hone par Dashboard par <strong>Red Alert</strong> aayega taaki highway impounding aur traffic challan se bacha ja sake.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Driver Master</strong></td>
            <td><code>Drivers (/drivers)</code></td>
            <td>Driver Name, Mobile No, HMV License No, License Expiry Date, Daily Bhatta (₹300/day), Monthly Fixed Salary.</td>
            <td>Company Lorry Settlement me driver ka advance aur diesel bhatta hisab isi se linked rehta hai.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>2️⃣ STEP 2: Client Booking & Advance Memo Banana (<code>/advance-memos</code>)</h2>
<p>Jab bhi kisi party (e.g. <em>M/s V-Trans</em>) ka phone aaye ki loading karni hai:</p>
<ol>
    <li>Left Sidebar me <strong>Advance Memo</strong> par jayein aur <strong>"+ Issue Advance Memo"</strong> click karein.</li>
    <li><strong>Form bharein:</strong>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Memo Number:</strong> Auto-generated (e.g. <code>#984</code>).</li>
            <li><strong>Date:</strong> Aaj ki date (e.g. <code>16/10/2026</code>).</li>
            <li><strong>Customer (M/s):</strong> Dropdown se select karein (e.g. <em>V-Trans Chennai</em>).</li>
            <li><strong>Truck No:</strong> Dropdown se free truck select karein (Company Fleet ya Market Lorry).</li>
            <li><strong>Route:</strong> Loading Point (<em>Pondicherry</em>) ➔ Unloading Point (<em>Panvel</em>).</li>
            <li><strong>Container Size:</strong> <code>20 Feet Container</code>.</li>
            <li><strong>Total Freight:</strong> Party se tay hua total bhaada (e.g. <code>₹35,000</code>).</li>
            <li><strong>Advance:</strong> Loading par party se mila/agreed advance (e.g. <code>₹28,000</code>).</li>
            <li><strong>Balance:</strong> Baaki bacha balance auto calculate hoga (<code>₹7,000</code>).</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><strong>Actions:</strong>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Print Pink Slip:</strong> Original pink paper slip format me print nikalein.</li>
            <li><strong>WhatsApp Share:</strong> 1-click me formatted memo party ko WhatsApp par bhejein.</li>
            <li><strong>Download PDF:</strong> Party ko email bhejne ke liye official PDF download karein.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ol>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>3️⃣ STEP 3: Trip Lifecycle & Status Kab aur Kaise Change Karein? (<code>/trips</code>)</h2>
<p>Advance Memo list me <strong>"Convert to Trip"</strong> click karein, ya Sidebar me <strong>Trip (Total Lorry)</strong> se naya trip open karein.</p>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Trip Status</th>
            <th>Kab Set Karein? (Real Situation)</th>
            <th>Kya Action Lena Hai?</th>
            <th>Next Step</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="badge badge-amber">1. PLANNED</span></td>
            <td>Jab gaadi allot ho gayi hai aur loading factory/port par khadi hai.</td>
            <td>Driver ko loading point par entry karwayein. Container truck par rakhein.</td>
            <td>Loading poori hone ka intezaar karein.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="badge badge-purple">2. DISPATCHED</span></td>
            <td>Jab container seal ho gaya, gate out challan mil gaya aur gaadi factory se nikal gayi.</td>
            <td>- Driver ko Fastag/Diesel advance dein.<br>- LR / Bilty generate karke driver ko handing-over karein.</td>
            <td>Gaadi highway par rawana karein.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="badge badge-blue">3. IN TRANSIT</span></td>
            <td>Jab gaadi highway par Safar kar rahi hai (Pondicherry ➔ Panvel).</td>
            <td>Daily driver se telephone location update lein aur en-route diesel slips note karein.</td>
            <td>Destination transit time monitor karein.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="badge badge-green">4. DELIVERED</span></td>
            <td>Jab gaadi destination warehouse pahunch kar container unload ho gaya.</td>
            <td><strong>SABSE ZAROORI:</strong> Unloading supervisor se <strong>Signed POD (Receiving Slip)</strong> lein aur software me POD Date enter karein.</td>
            <td>Driver Lorry Settlement aur Party Billing shuru karein.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="badge badge-green">5. COMPLETED</span></td>
            <td>Jab gaadi ka sara kharcha hisab ho gaya aur party ko invoice chala gaya.</td>
            <td>Trip status closed ho jata hai aur gaadi agle booking ke liye FREE ho jaati hai.</td>
            <td>P&L Report me final profit calculate ho jata hai.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>4️⃣ STEP 4: Lorry & Broker Ka Hisab (Two Tracks)</h2>

<h3>Track A: Company Fleet (Apni Gaadi) ➔ Driver Trip Settlement (<code>/driver-trip-settlements</code>)</h3>
<p>Trip khatam hone ke baad driver ke kharche ka hisab:</p>
<div class="formula-box">
Driver Advance Given (₹28,000)<br>
- Diesel Pump Slips (₹18,000)<br>
- Fastag & Cash Toll (₹4,200)<br>
- Loading/Unloading Hamali (₹1,000)<br>
- Urea / AdBlue (₹800)<br>
- Driver Bhatta (5 din x ₹300 = ₹1,500)<br>
------------------------------------------<br>
= Total Trip Expense: ₹25,500<br>
<strong>NET REFUND BY DRIVER TO OFFICE: ₹2,500</strong> (Advance - Kharcha)
</div>
<p>Left Sidebar me <strong>Company Lorry Settlement</strong> par jakar entry save karein aur <strong>"Mark as Settled ✓"</strong> click karein.</p>

<h3>Track B: Market Lorry (Broker Truck) ➔ Market Lorry Account (<code>/vendor-bills</code>)</h3>
<p>Agar hired market lorry chalayi thi toh broker ka hisab:</p>
<div class="formula-box">
Agreed Hire Freight (₹32,000)<br>
- Advance Paid at Loading (₹25,000)<br>
- TDS / Commission Deduction (₹500)<br>
------------------------------------------<br>
<strong>BALANCE PAYABLE TO BROKER: ₹6,500</strong>
</div>
<p>Left Sidebar me <strong>Market Lorry Account (Vendor Bills)</strong> me jayein, broker ko Axis Bank se ₹6,500 transfer karein aur bill <strong>"Paid"</strong> mark karein.</p>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>5️⃣ STEP 5: Customer Invoicing & Party Ledger (<code>/customer-invoices</code>)</h2>
<p>Client (M/s V-Trans) se pura freight lene ka process:</p>
<ol>
    <li>Left Sidebar ➔ <strong>Party Account (Customer Invoices)</strong> ➔ <strong>"+ New Invoice"</strong>.</li>
    <li>Customer select karein: <em>V-Trans (Chennai)</em> aur linked Delivered Trip select karein.</li>
    <li><strong>Invoice Calculation:</strong>
        <div class="formula-box">
        Basic Freight: ₹35,000<br>
        + Halting / Detention (Destination par gaadi rukne ka charge): ₹2,000<br>
        ------------------------------------------------------------<br>
        Total Invoice Bill: ₹37,000<br>
        - Less Advance Received on Memo: -₹28,000<br>
        ------------------------------------------------------------<br>
        <strong>NET BALANCE RECEIVABLE FROM PARTY: ₹9,000</strong>
        </div>
    </li>
    <li>Official GST Tax Invoice print karein aur party ko PDF WhatsApp/Email karein.</li>
    <li>Jab party baaki ka ₹9,000 aapke Axis Bank me transfer kar de:
        <ul>
            <li>Sidebar ➔ <strong>Customer Payments (<code>/customer-payments</code>)</strong> me jakar receipt entry karein.</li>
            <li>Party ka ledger balance <strong>₹0 (NIL)</strong> ho jayega!</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ol>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>6️⃣ STEP 6: En-Route & Office Expenses</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Driver En-Route Expenses (<code>/expenses</code>):</strong> Emergency highway kharcha, tyre puncture, RTO inspection fee, weighbridge (kanta) slip.</li>
    <li><strong>Office Administrative Expenses (<code>/office-expenses</code>):</strong> Vadodara office rent, electricity bill, staff chai-paani, printer paper, internet.</li>
    <li><strong>Fleet Fuel (<code>/fuels</code>):</strong> Pump-wise diesel accounts aur per-km average.</li>
    <li><strong>Maintenance & Repairs (<code>/maintenances</code>):</strong> Workshop job cards, engine oil, grease, brake liners.</li>
    <li><strong>Vehicle Loans & EMI (<code>/loans</code>):</strong> Bank loan EMI reminders aur interest calculation.</li>
</ul>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>7️⃣ STEP 7: Profit & Loss Engine (<code>/profit-loss</code>)</h2>
<p>Har trip aur poore mahine ka asli munafa kaise banta hai:</p>
<div class="formula-box">
  Total Freight Billed to Clients (Party Invoices)<br>
- Direct Trip Expenses (Diesel + Toll + Driver Bhatta)<br>
- Market Lorry Hire Paid to Brokers<br>
- Garage Maintenance & Tyre Replacement<br>
- Vehicle Bank Loan EMI Interest<br>
- Office Administrative Expenses (Rent, Chai, Staff)<br>
==================================================<br>
<strong>= NET BUSINESS PROFIT (Aapki Asli Bachat)</strong>
</div>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 20pt 0;" />

<h2>⚡ Cheat Sheet: Kaunsa Action Kab Kaam Aata Hai?</h2>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Aapko Kya Karna Hai?</th>
            <th>Kaha Jana Hai?</th>
            <th>Kaunsa Button Dabayein?</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>Nayi party add karni hai jiska maal uthana hai</td>
            <td><code>/customers</code></td>
            <td><code>+ Add Customer</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Naya truck fleet me add karna hai ya document renew karna hai</td>
            <td><code>/vehicles</code></td>
            <td><code>+ Add Vehicle</code> ya Edit Vehicle</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Naya driver rakhna hai</td>
            <td><code>/drivers</code></td>
            <td><code>+ Add Driver</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Client ne phone par gaadi mangi & rate tay hua</td>
            <td><code>/advance-memos</code></td>
            <td><code>+ Issue Advance Memo</code> ➔ Print Pink Slip / WhatsApp</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Truck factory se load hokar highway par nikal gaya</td>
            <td><code>/trips</code></td>
            <td><code>Convert to Trip</code> ➔ Status: <code>Dispatched</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Truck destination pahunch kar unload ho gaya & receiving mil gayi</td>
            <td><code>/trips</code></td>
            <td>Status: <code>Delivered</code> (POD Date enter karein)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Apni gaadi ke driver ka trip kharcha hisab settle karna hai</td>
            <td><code>/driver-trip-settlements</code></td>
            <td><code>+ New Settlement</code> ➔ Settle Advance vs Expenses</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Hired gaadi wale broker ko baaki paisa dena hai</td>
            <td><code>/vendor-bills</code></td>
            <td>Record Payment ➔ Status: <code>Paid</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Party ko final freight bill bhejna hai</td>
            <td><code>/customer-invoices</code></td>
            <td><code>+ New Invoice</code> ➔ Print Tax Invoice</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Party se baaki payment Axis Bank me receive ho gaya</td>
            <td><code>/customer-payments</code></td>
            <td><code>+ Record Payment</code> (Party Ledger Clear)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Mahine ka office rent ya chai-paani ka hisab daalna hai</td>
            <td><code>/office-expenses</code></td>
            <td><code>+ Record Expense</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Dekhna hai is mahine kitna net profit / munafa hua</td>
            <td><code>/profit-loss</code></td>
            <td>Select Month ➔ View Net Margin P&L</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

